- Risk per trade: 0.25% tài khoản.
- Maximum risk per trade: 0.5% tài khoản.
- Daily loss limit: 1.5%.
- Weekly loss limit: 4%.
- Maximum drawdown trigger: 8%.
- Default leverage: 1x.
- Maximum leverage: 3x.
- Maximum open positions: 3.
- Minimum risk/reward target: 1.5.
